s like elephants. They will grill you on your past actions: let's hope you remember what you signed this morning, because you'll have to justify it live.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double-Speak 2.0:</strong> Shine during press conferences. When a journalist asks &quot;Why?&quot;, answer with an inspiring speech that means absolutely nothing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Power Meter:</strong> Gain popularity to unlock more power. The more the people love you, the more you can get away with... without (too many) consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705900/extras/4986cfed3fd7b60a7c7f7dd30fec9ae1.poster.avif?t=1773670488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705900/extras/4986cfed3fd7b60a7c7f7dd30fec9ae1.webm?t=1773670488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705900/extras/4986cfed3fd7b60a7c7f7dd30fec9ae1.mp4?t=1773670488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Red Button:</strong> It\u2019s there. It\u2019s glowing. It\u2019s tempting. Press it. Go on. Just to see what happens.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Red Button Labs"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705900/cf9da0556a151947ec624038fe85d64d323e3acb/header.jpg?t=1773670488","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"President Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor